{"title": "Sharpshooter: All In", "pageid": 21514, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sharpshooter:_All_In", "categories": ["Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sharpshooter_All_In.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Sharpshooter_All_In.webp/300px-Sharpshooter_All_In.webp, /w/images/d/d6/Sharpshooter_All_In.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Sharpshooter_All_In.webp/300px-Sharpshooter_All_In.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Sharpshooter_All_In.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sharpshooter: All In</b> is a toggleable passive feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/Sharpshooter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sharpshooter\">Sharpshooter</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. Users of this feature are able to deal great damage at the cost of accuracy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Ranged weapon attacks with weapons you are <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficient</a> with have a -5 penalty to their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>, but deal an additional 10 damage. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Sharpshooter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sharpshooter\">Sharpshooter</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Devotee_of_Mahkloompah\" title=\"Devotee of Mahkloompah\">Devotee of Mahkloompah</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> Difficulty and lower, the additional damage is added to every damage instance caused by the attack. Bow attacks with multiple damage instances, such as elemental <a href=\"/wiki/Arrows\" title=\"Arrows\">arrows</a>, therefore can gain upwards of 20 damage from the feat.\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Honor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honor\">Honor</a> Mode, this is disabled.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>    \n